Value Filldown NAME (.+?)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)
Value Required ENTRY_TYPE (ip|range|exclude ip|exclude range|host|member|wildcard|country)
Value Required VALUE1 (\S+|".+?")
Value VALUE2 (\S+)

Start
  ^address\s+(?:id\s+\d+\s+)?"${NAME}"\s*$$ -> Address

Address
  ^\s+description\s+"${DESCRIPTION}"\s*$$
  ^\s+${ENTRY_TYPE}\s+${VALUE1}(?:\s+${VALUE2})?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*exit\s*$$ -> Start
